###

### Get all servicos
GET {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/servicos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get servico by ID
GET {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get servicos por SKU (filtro)
GET {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/servicos?sku=ABC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create servico
POST {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/servicos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "SERV001",
    "descricao": "Troca de óleo",
    "preco": 150.00
}

###

### Update servico
PUT {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "descricao": "Troca de óleo completa",
    "preco": 180.00
}

###

### Soft delete (inativar)
DELETE {{Mechanic_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}